Cell["\<\
With one label per marker except the terminal marker, only the actual initial \
and internal vertices are labelled. With one label per marker, the terminal \
label is placed on the last available sample, one index before the omitted \
terminal vertex.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1256073293,ExpressionUUID->"26deac35-5911-ba45-a4ad-89188c5aef3d"],

